{
  "base": "baseline",
  "description": "L2 surface detail (final). One global pipeline, no per-tile values: l2_surface.gdshader for every opaque role (ground: smoothed cell colour + height-field shading normal, material-class grain/patches from the ground colour, sand ripples, path grain + worn rim, slope earth, valley shade, sun glints on snow/sand; skirt: strata + grass lip + bottom shade; assets: base-to-top gradient, facet jitter, crease catch-lights from l2_edges; glow: glass by day, flicker at night), l2_water.gdshader (continuous depth colour from the height field, slope-aware shore foam + lapping bands, moving wave normals, crest glints), l2_scatter (grass tufts, flowers, pebbles, dry tufts, snow drifts, stalks, fallen leaves under warm-crowned trees; MultiMesh; density by ground class/theme, avoids footprints/paths/water/L叔). Built from rounds r1-r3.",
